e class=\"fp\" cx=\"150.7\" cy=\"50.7\" r=\"2.6\"/><text class=\"ft\" x=\"153.6\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B₁</text><circle class=\"fp\" cx=\"190.6\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\"/><text class=\"ft\" x=\"197.3\" y=\"14.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C₁</text><circle class=\"fp\" cx=\"119.3\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\"/><text class=\"ft\" x=\"117.1\" y=\"13.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">D₁</text></svg></figure>"
